            helpText: Drops the hierarchy and lists the posting accounts on their own, in name order, with no groups and no indenting. Every other filter still applies and the totals do not move - it is the same set of accounts, shown flat rather than as a tree. Levels has no meaning in this mode and is hidden while it is on.
